<title>USA: Cinco MUD 5, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce.</title>
<headline>Cinco MUD 5, Texas, won by Rauscher Pierce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it won $1.500 million of Cinco MUD 5, Texas, general obligation bonds, series 1996, with a net interest cost of 6.3218 percent.</p>
</text>
